SPAdes assemblies (2026-11-11 01:03:52)
---------------------------------------
    Unicycler now uses SPAdes to assemble the short reads. It scores the assembly graph for each k-mer using the number of contigs (fewer is better) and the number of dead ends (fewer is better). The score function is 1/(c*(d+2)), where c is the contig count and d is the dead end count.

spades.py -o /workspaces/genomics-lecture/dataset1/assembly_short/spades_assembly -k 25 --threads 4 --gfa11 --isolate -1 /workspaces/genomics-lecture/dataset1/short_reads_1.fastq.gz -2 /workspaces/genomics-lecture/dataset1/short_reads_2.fastq.gz -m 1024

